@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Search by title (case- and accent-insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?search=pokemon

### Limit results and page through them
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?search=spider&page=1&pageSize=5

### Page through every movie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?page=2&pageSize=50

### Filter by genre (case-insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?genre=science%20fiction

### Sort by release date, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?sortBy=releaseDate&sortDirection=desc

### Everything combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?search=star&genre=action&sortBy=releaseDate&sortDirection=desc&page=1&pageSize=10

### List genres (with movie counts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/genres

### Single movie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1

### Validation errors (pageSize out of range, unknown sort field)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?pageSize=500&sortBy=rating

### Health: all checks
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Health: liveness (process up)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Health: readiness (database populated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
